{"id":"6c9094f9aaf890d2","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-accessibility-rank.md","title":"可及元素的序数秩","display":"df-accessibility-rank — 可及元素的序数秩","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-accessibility-rank","aliases":["72-df-accessibility-rank"],"display":"df-accessibility-rank — 可及元素的序数秩","depends_on":["[[72-thm-accessible-part-well-founded]]"],"chapter":"IV","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IV §3.2.2, print270–271/PDF282–283; local well-founded recursion","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local well-definedness argument recorded","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revised":"2026-10-22","revision_2026_10_22":"本轮新增节点保守记录为尚未完成完整依赖资格认证"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-accessibility-rank"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-accessibility-rank</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-accessibility-rank — 可及元素的序数秩"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ce118b25d2b12cdc\" href=\"?note=ce118b25d2b12cdc\" title=\"72-thm-accessible-part-well-founded\">72-thm-accessible-part-well-founded</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"IV"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IV §3.2.2, print270–271/PDF282–283; local well-founded recursion"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local well-definedness argument recorded"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_2026_10_22","html":"本轮新增节点保守记录为尚未完成完整依赖资格认证"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(O,\\prec)\">\\((O,\\prec)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A:=\\mathrm{Acc}_\\prec\">\\(A:=\\mathrm{Acc}_\\prec\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ce118b25d2b12cdc\" href=\"?note=ce118b25d2b12cdc\" title=\"72-thm-accessible-part-well-founded\">72-thm-accessible-part-well-founded</a>；限制关系已良基且A向下闭。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 遍历集合编码函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ord}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ord}\\)</span> 表示序数类的ZFC定义谓词。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_{O,\\prec}\">\\(\\rho_{O,\\prec}\\)</span> 在下式通过唯一描述引入，定义域仅为A。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists!r\\ \\bigl[\\operatorname{dom}(r)=A\\land\\forall a\\in A\\ \\bigl(r(a)\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\land r(a)=\\sup\\{r(b)+1:b\\in A,\\ b\\prec a\\}\\bigr)\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists!r\\ \\bigl[\\operatorname{dom}(r)=A\\land\\forall a\\in A\\ \\bigl(r(a)\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\land r(a)=\\sup\\{r(b)+1:b\\in A,\\ b\\prec a\\}\\bigr)\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho_{O,\\prec}:=\\iota r\\ \\bigl[\\operatorname{dom}(r)=A\\land\\forall a\\in A\\ \\bigl(r(a)\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\land r(a)=\\sup\\{r(b)+1:b\\in A,\\ b\\prec a\\}\\bigr)\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho_{O,\\prec}:=\\iota r\\ \\bigl[\\operatorname{dom}(r)=A\\land\\forall a\\in A\\ \\bigl(r(a)\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\land r(a)=\\sup\\{r(b)+1:b\\in A,\\ b\\prec a\\}\\bigr)\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall a,b\\in A\\quad b\\prec a\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\rho_{O,\\prec}(b)&lt;\\rho_{O,\\prec}(a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall a,b\\in A\\quad b\\prec a\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\rho_{O,\\prec}(b)&lt;\\rho_{O,\\prec}(a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>在A上的良基关系递归中，每一步只取前驱秩的后继所构成的集合的上确界，因此输出序数唯一；替换公理使全部值组成集合函数。空前驱集的秩为0。每个前驱的后继不超过该上确界，故秩严格下降。只在可及部分构造；没有把非良基关系上的任意元素预先赋予“秩”。该秩也不是任意外延序数命名函数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-thm-accessible-part-well-founded","status":"resolved","id":"ce118b25d2b12cdc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-accessible-part-well-founded]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-accessible-part-well-founded","status":"resolved","id":"ce118b25d2b12cdc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(O,\\prec)$ 与 $A:=\\mathrm{Acc}_\\prec$ 取 [[72-thm-accessible-part-well-founded]]；限制关系已良基且A向下闭。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"(O,\\prec)","display":false},{"tex":"A:=\\mathrm{Acc}_\\prec","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho_{O,\\prec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists!r\\ \\bigl[\\operatorname{dom}(r)=A\\land\\forall a\\in A\\ \\bigl(r(a)\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\land r(a)=\\sup\\{r(b)+1:b\\in A,\\ b\\prec a\\}\\bigr)\\bigr].","display":true},{"tex":"\\rho_{O,\\prec}:=\\iota r\\ \\bigl[\\operatorname{dom}(r)=A\\land\\forall a\\in A\\ \\bigl(r(a)\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\land r(a)=\\sup\\{r(b)+1:b\\in A,\\ b\\prec a\\}\\bigr)\\bigr].","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall a,b\\in A\\quad b\\prec a\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\rho_{O,\\prec}(b)<\\rho_{O,\\prec}(a).","display":true}],"bytes":1979,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-450","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-accessibility-rank|df-accessibility-rank — 可及元素的序数秩]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-422","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-accessibility-rank]]"},{"id":"2e1cc33090ad6f68","anchor":"ref-69","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"可及序数秩：[[72-df-accessibility-rank]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-310","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-accessibility-rank|df-accessibility-rank — 可及元素的序数秩]]"},{"id":"f6f38fb4ec14b41d","anchor":"ref-69","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-accessibility-rank]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-accessibility-rank]]"}],"outgoing":["ce118b25d2b12cdc"]}